<title>FRANCE: Juppe said Thomson decision based on defence logic.</title>
<headline>Juppe said Thomson decision based on defence logic.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Alain Juppe said on Wednesday his government had decided to sell Thomson SA to Lagardere Groupe instead of Alcatel Alsthom for defence industrial reasons.</p>
<p>&quot;The choice I have made yesterday and which has been made public today is entirely based on a defence industrial logic,&quot; Juppe told parliament.</p>
<p>&quot;We have opted for the offer which was the best to further our defence interest and which would constitute a world leading industrial group with strong export capacities,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Thomson Matra group which will be formed, if the privatisation commission gives its permission, will be the second biggest group in the world in professional electronics,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
